{"1":{"w":[{"c":"وَيْلٌ","d":"waylun","e":"Woe"},{"c":"لِكُلِّ","d":"likulli","e":"to every"},{"c":"هُمَزَةٍ","d":"humazatin","e":"slanderer"},{"c":"لُمَزَةٍ","d":"lumazatin","e":"backbiter!"}],"a":{"g":"Woe to every scorner and mocker"}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"The one who"},{"c":"جَمَعَ","d":"jamaʿa","e":"collects"},{"c":"مَالًا","d":"mālan","e":"wealth"},{"c":"وَعَدَّدَهُ","d":"waʿaddadahu","e":"and counts it"}],"a":{"g":"Who collects wealth and [continuously] counts it."}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"يَحْسَبُ","d":"yaḥsabu","e":"Thinking"},{"c":"أَنَّ","d":"anna","e":"that"},{"c":"مَالَهُ","d":"mālahu","e":"his wealth"},{"c":"أَخْلَدَهُ","d":"akhladahu","e":"will make him immortal"}],"a":{"g":"He thinks that his wealth will make him immortal."}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"كَلَّا","d":"kallā","e":"Nay!"},{"c":"لَيُنْبَذَنَّ","d":"layunbadhanna","e":"Surely he will be thrown"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"الْحُطَمَةِ","d":"l-ḥuṭamati","e":"the Crusher"}],"a":{"g":"No! He will surely be thrown into the Crusher."}},"5":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And what"},{"c":"أَدْرَاكَ","d":"adrāka","e":"will make you know"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"الْحُطَمَةُ","d":"l-ḥuṭamatu","e":"the Crusher (is)"}],"a":{"g":"And what can make you know what is the Crusher?"}},"6":{"w":[{"c":"نَارُ","d":"nāru","e":"A Fire"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"Allah"},{"c":"الْمُوقَدَةُ","d":"l-mūqadatu","e":"kindled"}],"a":{"g":"It is the fire of Allah, [eternally] fueled,"}},"7":{"w":[{"c":"الَّتِي","d":"allatī","e":"Which"},{"c":"تَطَّلِعُ","d":"taṭṭaliʿu","e":"mounts up"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"to"},{"c":"الْأَفْئِدَةِ","d":"l-afidati","e":"the hearts"}],"a":{"g":"Which mounts directed at the hearts."}},"8":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّهَا","d":"innahā","e":"Indeed it"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِمْ","d":"ʿalayhim","e":"(will be) upon them"},{"c":"مُؤْصَدَةٌ","d":"mu'ṣadatun","e":"closed over"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, Hellfire will be closed down upon them"}},"9":{"w":[{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"In"},{"c":"عَمَدٍ","d":"ʿamadin","e":"columns"},{"c":"مُمَدَّدَةٍ","d":"mumaddadatin","e":"extended"}],"a":{"g":"In extended columns."}}}